From: OpenBMC Orange Pi Zero 2 integration
Subject: [PATCH] ikvm: add CH32V307 HID bridge with CH340 auto discovery

Route KVM keyboard and absolute-pointer reports to a CH32V307 over a
framed 921600-baud serial protocol. Support automatic CH340/CH341 discovery
by USB VID/PID, periodic heartbeats, hot-unplug recovery, and reconnects.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific hardware integration]

